WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.975
Section 2.

00:00:01.925 --> 00:00:03.800
CBC.

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:06.712
The 1.4 Billion Question.

00:00:06.712 --> 00:00:15.787
The question is not whether Canada should have a public broadcaster, but whether a public broadcaster funded by the government holds that government accountable.
